# Cargo build output (the compiled artifacts are never committed).
/target
# The hanoi container's separate Cargo target (CARGO_TARGET_DIR for the make
# rust-* targets; caches wxDragon's from-source wxWidgets build across runs).
/.container-target
# The hanoi container's Cargo home (CARGO_HOME for the make rust-* AND rust-tauri
# targets; persists the crate-registry download cache across --rm runs so crates
# are fetched once, not every run). Shared by the workspace and the Tauri crate.
/.container-cargo
